    prov:value "[{\"role\": \"user\", \"parts\": [{\"content\": \"Write a short brief on Lisbon's weather and facts.\", \"type\": \"text\"}]}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"parts\": [{\"content\": \"We need to call agents in parallel: weather_agent and facts_agent. Then transfer to writer with what they found. The coordinator must call every agent needed at once, in parallel. So we need to invoke weather_agent and facts_agent concurrently. Then after getting results, we transfer to writer with the findings. However the instruction: \\\"In your first reply, call every agent you need at once, in parallel. Then transfer to the writer with what they found.\\\" So we should first call both agents, then after we get their responses, we transfer to writer. But we need to produce a first reply that calls the agents. Probably we should output function calls for weather_agent and facts_agent. Then after they return, we will transfer to writer. But we as coordinator need to produce the function calls now. So we will call both.\\n\\nWe need to pass request: likely \\\"Lisbon\\\". For weather_agent: request \\\"Lisbon weather\\\". For facts_agent: request \\\"Lisbon facts\\\". Let's do that.\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"id\": \"call-6b32c438-c83f-4368-99a2-79c1a01be8e7\", \"name\": \"weather_agent\", \"arguments\": {\"request\": \"Lisbon weather\"}, \"type\": \"tool_call\"}, {\"id\": \"call-918fd332-05d8-49d1-b2d3-53724e8dfb79\", \"name\": \"facts_agent\", \"arguments\": {\"request\": \"Lisbon facts\"}, \"type\": \"tool_call\"}]}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"parts\": [{\"id\": \"call-6b32c438-c83f-4368-99a2-79c1a01be8e7\", \"response\": {\"result\": \"Lisbon is currently 21\\u202f\\u00b0C with clear skies.\"}, \"type\": \"tool_call_response\"}, {\"id\": \"call-918fd332-05d8-49d1-b2d3-53724e8dfb79\", \"response\": {\"result\": \"Lisbon is the capital of Portugal and lies on the Tagus estuary.\"}, \"type\": \"tool_call_response\"}]}]" .

